<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xsl:stylesheet version="1.0" xmlns:xsl="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform" xmlns:s="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9" xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" exclude-result-prefixes="s xhtml">
<xsl:output method="html" encoding="UTF-8"/>
<xsl:template match="/">
<html lang="en"><head><title>XML Sitemap | Bulex Plombier</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:#202126;font:16px/1.6 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:44px 24px}a{color:#a8002a;text-underline-offset:3px}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #202126;outline-offset:4px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:26px 0 16px}.brand{font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none}p{max-width:800px}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:32px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}th{text-align:left;background:#f5f5f6;border-top:3px solid #a8002a;padding:14px}td{border-bottom:1px solid #dedee1;padding:12px 14px;vertical-align:top}td:first-child{color:#555}td a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}th:first-child{width:32px}.alternates a{display:inline-block;margin-right:12px;min-height:26px;white-space:nowrap}.date{white-space:nowrap;color:#555}footer{margin-top:32px;font-size:14px;color:#555}@media(max-width:600px){main{padding:28px 16px}h1{font-size:32px}table{min-width:700px}}</style></head>
<body><main><a class="brand" href="/">Bulex Plombier</a><h1>XML Sitemap</h1><p>This sitemap lists <strong><xsl:value-of select="count(s:urlset/s:url)"/> published pages</strong> for search engines, including their Dutch and English alternatives.</p><p>For a simpler view on any browser, open the <a href="/sitemap">readable website sitemap</a>.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Page URL</th><th scope="col">Languages</th><th scope="col">Last updated</th></tr></thead><tbody><xsl:for-each select="s:urlset/s:url"><tr><td><xsl:value-of select="position()"/></td><td><a href="{s:loc}"><xsl:value-of select="s:loc"/></a></td><td class="alternates"><xsl:for-each select="xhtml:link"><a href="{@href}" hreflang="{@hreflang}"><xsl:value-of select="@hreflang"/></a></xsl:for-each></td><td class="date"><xsl:choose><xsl:when test="s:lastmod"><xsl:value-of select="substring(s:lastmod,1,10)"/></xsl:when><xsl:otherwise>Not supplied</xsl:otherwise></xsl:choose></td></tr></xsl:for-each></tbody></table></div><footer>Dates appear only when an actual publication or modification date is available. Scheduled articles are included after publication.</footer></main></body></html>
</xsl:template>
</xsl:stylesheet>
